now as we close out the new year  the current year i should say and enter  the new year eight news now and our next  our sister stations are teaming up to  raise money to provide meals for one  million people in need with our super  bowl of caring  help out this year with the super bowl  of caring it began 30 years ago in a  church in south carolina with one prayer  on super bowl sunday to be mindful of  those who don't have a bowl full of soup  to eat the youth at that church took  that on as a as a challenge  and they asked the question what if  everybody watching the big game just  gave a dollar or one can of food and if  you look at that today that would be a  hundred million dollars in one day  executive director allison reese says  they've got a large network and by using  the tackle hunger map you can use the  search bar to find charities in your  neighborhood zip code or city to  encourage thinking locally about giving  to churches homeless shelters pantries  and food banks most people don't know  where their nearest food charity is  and that's something that we're trying  to address using our map super bowl of  caring doesn't deliver food directly it  acts more like a catalyst by infusing  money into the food charities across the  nation and with next our nation's  outreach this year the non-profit hopes  you will help raise more than one  million meals  [Music]  and you can help out our food bank right  here in las vegas which of course is  three square just click on the qr code  on the screen and make a donation you  can also find other charities in the  valley on the tackle hunger map as we  mentioned and it will count toward the  super bowl of caring goal
 

